    "summary": "Basket (with lid), plaited of dyed and undyed palm fibre. Basket decorated with fibre dyed fuchsia in a zigzag pattern on an undyed background. Bottom of basket all undyed fibre on outside, all fuchsia dyed fibre on inside; thin fuchsia cross stitched across the bottom. Lid all fuchsia dyed fibre on outside; all undyed fibre on inside; decorated around the brim with zigzag pattern in fuchsia dyed fibre on an undyed background. Top of lid decorated with a thin pink cross stitched on the top.",
